  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with singleprofile and pca_n2000 RNA encoder achieve ~0.526 validation accuracy. This experiment tests the baseline performance of a unimodal RNA-only model with the same RNA encoder to determine if multimodal approaches provide a meaningful advantage. It directly addresses the uncertainty about the necessity of image data and isolates the impact of modality choice, which is critical for prioritizing resource allocation."
}

